<title>HONG KONG: Paliburg a buyer of Stanley site.</title>
<headline>Paliburg a buyer of Stanley site.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paliburg Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it was a buyer of the Stanley site at a Hong Kong government land auction.  </p>
<p>The site sold for HK$5.5 billion at the Hong Kong government's last land auction before the territory returns to Chinese rule on midnight of June 30.</p>
<p>Market sources said China Overseas Land and Investment Ltd had joined Paliburg in the successful bidding.</p>
<p>China Overseas could not be immediately reached.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6345  http://www.hk97.com</p>
